==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid66.svg|32px]] '''Silk ControlGrid66''' command creates a ControlGrid66 from 4 connected [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly6.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlPoly6|ControlPoly6]] edges.

