==Usage==

# Select 4 connected [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly6.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlPoly6|ControlPoly6]] edges in the [[3D_View|3D View]].
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_ControlGrid66.svg|16px]] ControlGrid66}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid66.svg|16px]] ControlGrid66}} option from the menu.
# A '''ControlGrid66_4''' object, is created.

== Properties ==

See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

A  '''ControlGrid66_4''' is derived from a [[Part_Feature|Part feature]], or more precise a {{Incode|Part::FeaturePython}} object, and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional property:

=== Data ===

{{Properties_Title|C1 - Inputs}}

* {{PropertyData|Poly0|Link}}: First control polygon.
* {{PropertyData|Poly1|Link}}: Second control polygon.
* {{PropertyData|Poly2|Link}}: Third control polygon.
* {{PropertyData|Poly3|Link}}: Fourth control polygon.
* {{PropertyData|reverse|Bool}}: Default is {{value|False}}. Reverses the parameter direction.
* {{PropertyData|tolerance|Float}}: Default is {{value|1e-06}}. Point-to-point connection tolerance for the 4 corners.

{{Properties_Title|C2 - Outputs}}

* {{PropertyData|Legs|Part::PropertyGeometryList}}: Control segments.
* {{PropertyData|Poles|VectorList}}: Poles.
* {{PropertyData|Weights|FloatList}}: Weights.

{{Properties_Title|C3 - Identifiers}}

* {{PropertyData|internalName|String}}: The permanent internal FreeCAD name for this object.
* {{PropertyData|object_type|String}}: Default is {{value|ControlGrid66_4}}. The workbench class used to create this object.
* {{PropertyData|object_version|String}}: The class version of this object.


